docs/README.md:137:- competition-pairing.md: Entry-order seeds and opening pairings for four- and eight-person brackets, with named examples.
docs/README.md:138:- competition-rounds.md: Round names and their displayed text, with distinctions between event stages and browser session generations.
docs/README.md:139:- competition-boards.md: Board dimensions by stage, their face sets, and implications for layout and navigation.
docs/README.md:140:- competition-deals.md: Match deal identity, board-code reproducibility, and the limits of the current fresh-deal helper.
docs/README.md:141:- competition-ties.md: Ordered result comparison, active-time precision, and seed priority for equal results.
docs/README.md:142:- competition-scores.md: Competition isolation from ordinary saved size and best moves, including the current session write paths.
