docs/adr-043-keyboard-parity.md:35:Pointer and touch, Board keyboard navigation, ADR 022 and ADR 047 provide the related interaction rationale. The central outcome is one game transition path, surrounded by input-specific browser behavior rather than duplicated game rules.
